      "summary": {
        "text": "Jules Jean-Louis Gounon (born 31 December 1994 in Aubenas) is an Andorran-based French professional racing driver. A former Bentley factory driver, he currently competes in the FIA World Endurance Championship for Alpine and in various GT racing series for Mercedes-AMG. He is best known for his victories in the 24 Hours of Spa in 2017 and 2022, and the Bathurst 12 Hour in 2020, 2022 and 2023.",
